<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched 105 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$41.36     PREMIUM	 9.97 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.7027    GEARING	 6.26x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 11.JUN.97    LISTING DATE  07.JUL.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.APR.98    PAYDATE	 04.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$44</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
